BT 1 0 0 1 0 41.8 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 12.8 TL 1.382826 Tw (The Student Contact Directory is a console-based Java program that stores the contacts of students. Each) Tj T* 0 Tw .918399 Tw (contact has a name, a phone number and an email address. The user can add, display, search, update and) Tj T* 0 Tw .873399 Tw (delete contacts through a text menu. It is a beginner-level Data Structures and Algorithms \(DSA\) project \(PS) Tj T* 0 Tw (No. 24\).) Tj T* ET
