BT 1 0 0 1 0 29 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 12.8 TL 1.11941 Tw (Every contact is stored as an object in an ArrayList. A HashMap with the phone number as the key detects) Tj T* 0 Tw .048377 Tw (duplicate phone numbers and gives direct access to a contact by phone. Contacts can be searched by name or) Tj T* 0 Tw (by phone number. A valid phone number has exactly 10 digits.) Tj T* ET
