BT 1 0 0 1 0 29 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 12.8 TL .583199 Tw (A contact directory is used in every college to reach classmates, class representatives and teachers. Keeping) Tj T* 0 Tw .252566 Tw (contacts only in memory is not enough, because they would be lost when the program closes, and duplicate or) Tj T* 0 Tw (wrongly typed phone numbers would make the directory unreliable.) Tj T* ET
