BT 1 0 0 1 18 29 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 12.8 TL (When the program starts, contacts.txt is read line by line. Each line \(name, phone, email\) is turned into a) Tj T* (Contact object, added to the ArrayList and put in the HashMap with the phone as key. If the file does not) Tj T* (exist, the directory starts empty.) Tj T* ET
