BT 1 0 0 1 18 29 Tm 12.8 TL /F2 9.4 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Add:) Tj /F1 9.4 Tf ( the name, phone and email are read. The phone must have exactly 10 digits and must not already be) Tj T* (a key in the HashMap. A valid contact is added to the ArrayList and the HashMap, and "Contact added." is) Tj T* (shown with its details.) Tj T* ET
